00:00:01.996 --> 00:00:03.992 align:middle line:90%
[RUSTLING]

00:00:03.992 --> 00:00:05.988 align:middle line:90%
[CLICKING]

00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:12.980 align:middle line:90%


00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.309 align:middle line:90%
YAEL T. KALAI: Let's start.

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:19.590 align:middle line:84%
So first homework
assignment is out.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:25.310 align:middle line:84%
As I said, it's due right
before Thanksgiving.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:28.790 align:middle line:84%
If anybody needs an
extension, just let me know.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:33.110 align:middle line:84%
And the instructions
are on the site.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.598 align:middle line:84%
Essentially, each one should
write like their own solution so

00:00:37.598 --> 00:00:38.640 align:middle line:90%
make sure you understand.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.670 align:middle line:84%
It's OK if you talk
among one another

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.060 align:middle line:90%
as long as it's fruitful.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.450 align:middle line:84%
And please type it up
in LATAC and submit it

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.420 align:middle line:90%
through Gradescope.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:45.920 align:middle line:90%
